Ques12: Explain the complete signal flow in a drone ?
Signal Flow in a Drone - 
Pilot Input : The pilot gives commands using the remote controller.
Radio Transmitter: Sends the pilot’s commands wirelessly.
Radio Receiver: receives the signals on the drone.
Flight Controller: Processes the signals and decides how the drone should move.
ESC (Electronic Speed Controller): Controls the speed of each BLDC motor.
BLDC Motors: Rotate the properties.
Propellers: Produce lift and thrust.
Drone Movement: The drone takes off, lands, hovers, or moves in different directions.
